"lastcall  3 repos · 6 files · 8 hunks  standalone  [Accept All]                           watching W"
"┌──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│alpha                     │f1  M  +1 −1                           [A accept file] [U restore file]│"
"┌ keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│ ↑ / k          previous entry / scroll up              U              restore the whole file     │"
"│ ↓ / j          next entry / scroll down                m              flag it with a note        │"
"│ PgUp / b       page up                                 M              clear the file's flags     │"
"│ PgDn / Space   page down                               v              select lines               │"
"│ ⏎ / l / →      open the diff                           y              copy selection             │"
"│ Esc / h / ←    back to the file list (close help)      i              edit in place              │"
"│ Tab            toggle focus                            I              $EDITOR at the hunk        │"
"│ n / ]          next hunk                               d              ack the agent flag         │"
"│ p / [          previous hunk                           g              jump to the agent in herdr │"
"│ e              expand a collapsed file                 w              workspace scope on/off     │"
"│ f              full paths                              r              rescan now                 │"
"│ o              show org/repo                           ?              this help                  │"
"│ a              accept the hunk or the selected entry   q / Ctrl-C     quit                       │"
"│ A              accept the whole file                   y / ⏎          confirm                    │"
"│ Ctrl-A         accept everything listed                n / Esc        cancel                     │"
"│ u              restore the hunk                                                                  │"
"│                                                                                                  │"
"│ ^J is a newline in the note (⇧⏎ needs a kitty-protocol terminal)                                 │"
"│ shift+drag selects text (mouse capture is on) · v/y copies                                       │"
"│                                                                                                  │"
"│ any key closes                                                                                   │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
"│                          │                                                                       │"
"│                          │                                                                       │"
"└──────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
